@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-12 Receive Payment Webhook

class "Checkout / Payment UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "Coupon" as Coupon <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : POST /payments/webhook or POST /payments/stripe/webhook
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> Coupon : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses
Service --> "PayOS Gateway" : integrates
Service --> "Stripe Gateway" : integrates
Service --> "Gmail SMTP" : email notification

note right of UI
UC-12 - Receive Payment Webhook
Actors: PayOS Gateway, Stripe Gateway
Pre: Payment đã được khởi tạo bởi PayOS/Stripe
Post: Order status được cập nhật
end note
@enduml
